"key": "fplratings",
"url": "https://fplratings.com/matchups",
"date": "2026-10-14 fetch (Gameweek 7 only)",
"scale": "xGA per game (goals)",
"meaning": "fplratings_opp_xga = opponent's estimated xGA per game (higher = weaker opponent defence = easier for attackers); GW7 only and only for teams that had a player listed (12 teams). Values are nearly flat (1.45-1.55) so of little discriminating use. Its /fixtures/ planner shows only colour-coded cells (no numbers) and states ratings are based on 2025-26 completed matches; only run totals visible: Spurs 13.0 easiest next-6, Brentford 19.9 hardest next-6 (home fixtures get -0.4)."
},
{
"key": "ffh",
