"meaning": "Fantasy Football Hub GW7 article; only exact quoted figures kept (TOT vs COV 2.34 goals, 38% CS; IPS at MCI 0.94 goals). Also stated approximately: MCI 'just under three goals' and 'creeping over 41%' CS, ARS CS 'over 41%', NFO 'under one goal' (not stored)."
},
{
"key": "full90",
